flowchart LR
    accTitle: Current Cosmos Inference Boundary
    accDescr: Native loading and checkpoint audit precede binding owned Cosmos policy, sampler and DiT execution code. Optional fusion and precision adapters preserve the engine boundary. VAE and attention services remain external. CPU action chunks are returned to the runner.
    resources["Policy checkpoint / VAE / statistics / T5"] --> load["Native model loading and coverage audit"]
    case_config["Explicit case: LIBERO H16 or RoboCasa H32"] --> load
    observations["Raw cameras and 9D proprio"] --> preprocessing["Flip once, then native JPEG / resize / normalization"]
    load --> binding["Bind owned policy / sampler / DiT"]
    binding -. "model and cached resources" .-> inference["Owned Cosmos get_action"]
    preprocessing --> inference
    inference --> extraction["Action chunk extraction and unnormalization"]
    inference --> optimizations["Optional BF16 fusion / graph / low precision"]
    optimizations --> kernels["Independent robotics kernels"]
    inference --> dependencies["External VAE / attention services"]
    extraction --> cpu_actions["Finite CPU action array: H by 7"]
    cpu_actions --> runner["Runner executes first n actions"]
    classDef existing fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d
    classDef external fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b,color:#0f172a
    class load,binding,inference,optimizations,kernels,case_config,observations,preprocessing,extraction,cpu_actions,runner existing
